{"title": "懒融其人", "index": 1068, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre4\" id=\"CIEDC0-f63310eb08dd4d5faea408e62c2fdc23\">\n<h1 class=\"kindle-cn-heading4\" id=\"calibre_pb_1\">懒融其人</h1>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-poem-center1\">观是何人心何物，本来这个不须寻。<br class=\"calibre15\"/>\n  百花落尽春无尽，山自高兮水自深。</p>\n</body>"}]}